      "statusChangeNewStatus": "complete",
      "value": "This thread was originally made during a time when Udon was \"perpetually soonTM\" so the request was more specifically about adding these features to SDK2. However, now that udon has been out for a while and these features have been added to Udon, it's clear that SDK2 will not receive such features as it is intended to stay exactly how it is for long term.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
